{"id":5265,"date":"2024-12-06T23:00:41","date_gmt":"2024-12-06T15:00:41","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=5265"},"modified":"2024-12-06T23:01:16","modified_gmt":"2024-12-06T15:01:16","slug":"pulse-jet-filter-bags","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=pulse-jet-filter-bags","title":{"rendered":"Pulse Jet Filter Bags"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Pulse jet bag filters are a common type of industrial dust collection equipment used to capture and filter airborne particles. It consists of one or more filter bags, each of which is mounted on a bracket and connected to a dust collector or dust collection system. These filter bags are usually made of fine filter material that can effectively capture particles of various sizes.\u00a0 This type of filter is usually used in industrial environments that require efficient dust collection, such as steel plants, cement plants, chemical plants, etc.<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-5270\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pulse-Jet-Filter-02-detail1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"435\" height=\"435\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pulse-Jet-Filter-02-detail1.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pulse-Jet-Filter-02-detail1-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pulse-Jet-Filter-02-detail1-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pulse-Jet-Filter-02-detail1-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 435px) 100vw, 435px\" \/> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-5271\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bag-House-Filter-detail2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"427\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bag-House-Filter-detail2.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bag-House-Filter-detail2-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bag-House-Filter-detail2-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Bag-House-Filter-detail2-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 427px) 100vw, 427px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3>Working Principle<\/h3>\n<p>The working principle of pulse jet bag filter is to remove dust through pulse jet technology. When a certain amount of particulate matter accumulates on the surface of the filter bag, the injection system releases a burst of compressed air or gas to remove the particulate matter from the surface. This cleaning process is carried out along the length of or around the filter bag via a spray device to ensure complete removal.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5273\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-Principle-of-Pulse-Jet-Bag-Filter-detail3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"868\" height=\"350\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-Principle-of-Pulse-Jet-Bag-Filter-detail3.jpg 868w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-Principle-of-Pulse-Jet-Bag-Filter-detail3-300x121.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-Principle-of-Pulse-Jet-Bag-Filter-detail3-768x310.jpg 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Working-Principle-of-Pulse-Jet-Bag-Filter-detail3-600x242.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 868px) 100vw, 868px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3>Pulse Jet Filter Bags by Temperature<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Room Temperature Filter Bags<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The room temperature bag is mainly made of polyester, polypropylene, acrylic and other fibers through non-woven and textile technology. It has good air permeability, smooth surface, good dimensional stability, easy to peel off dust and other excellent performance. It is mainly used in dust removal and normal temperature flue gas treatment in industries where dust pollution occurs in general industrial enterprises.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Medium-temperature Filter Bags<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>At present, the common medium-temperature filter material is aramid fiber, PPS series fiber through the immersion, waterproof, anti-oil, anti-corrosion process, so as to achieve the desired effect.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>High-temperature Filter Bags<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>High-temperature cloth bags are mainly made of high-strength fibers such as P84, expanded glass fiber and ultra-fine glass fiber, which are processed through spinning and non-woven processes. They are characterized by good thermal stability, high filtration efficiency and long service life. Mainly used in dust collectors under various high-temperature flue gas conditions.<\/p>\n<h3>Material Selection<\/h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Working Condition\">Working Condition<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Material\">Material<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Weight (g\/m? )\">Weight (g\/m\u00b2 )<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-D1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Thickness (mm)\">Thickness (mm)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-E1\" colspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Temperature Resistance (\u00b0C)\">Temperature Resistance (\u00b0C)<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-G1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Air permeability (L\/ dm2* 'min)\">Air permeability (L\/ dm2*min)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-E2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Continu es\">Continues<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-F2\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Instant\">Instant<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td id=\"sjs-A3\" rowspan=\"4\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Room Temperature 0~120C\">Room Temperature 0~120\u00b0C<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-B3\" data-t=\"s\" data-v=\"Polyester\">Polyester<\/td>\n<td id=\"sjs-C3\" data-t=\"s\" d